CREATED:20201027T233850Z
DESCRIPTION:THIS EVENT WILL BE HELD IN ENGLISH.<br><br><b>3. Volt Blind Dat
 e - it’s time for some international feelings!</b><br><br><b>Hey everyone!<
 /b><br>Here is your next chance for a pan-European interaction. 37 teams al
 ready had a nice exchange of experiences\, ideas\, problems or just a wonde
 rful evening with another Volt team. Six teams did it twice. Now is your ch
 ance to take part in the 3rd round of&nbsp\;<b>Volt-Blind-Date!</b><br><br>
 <b>OUR INTENTION!</b><br>For some of us the European level seems so far awa
 y\, because we only think in vertical axes and are having the most Volt imp
 act on the local or national level. We hope to improve the Volt spirit when
  we have more horizontal exchange directly with other local teams European-
 wide.&nbsp\;<br><br>Also we like to enable an European exchange for Volt me
 mbers who aren’t so active on Workplace or prefer to talk directly with peo
 ple. For the short run you could have a wonderful evening\, exchange about 
 challenges\, success stories and empower each other. In the long run you co
 uld build a partnership\, have an international Meet&amp\;Greet or challeng
 e some projects together.&nbsp\;<b>That depends on you and your team!</b>\n
 \nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: https://meet.google.com/aay-uedt-xte\nOder t
 elefonisch: (DE) +49 30 300195174 PIN: 460889142#\nWeitere Telefonnummern: 
 https://tel.meet/aay-uedt-xte?pin=8477987911354&hs=7\n\nWeitere Information
 en zu Meet: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20201102T125502Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Volt Blind Date #3 (English!)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
