UID:15nfk7tuqijlv39cfh30pqaoul@google.com
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/yhf-ebbz-rnt
CREATED:20210726T164137Z
DESCRIPTION:<b><p>Did you know that you\, as an EU citizen registered in Be
 rlin\, are eligible to vote in the Berlin District Council (the <i>Bezirksv
 erordnetenversammlung</i>\, or <i>BVV</i> in short) this September?</p><p><
 b>The District Council is a very important political body that decides abou
 t all the things going on right in front of your doorstep: This could be ev
 erything from the location of new bike lanes or green spaces to which NGOs 
 will be supported in your area.&nbsp\;</b></p></b>This is your city\, too -
  and you should make your voice heard.<br><br>So how can you vote?<br><br>W
 e'll help you make sense of the bureaucracy and explain which steps to take
  to vote. It's really rather simple\, we promise.<br><br>No prior knowledge
  of Germany's political or party system is necessary - just come as you are
 .<br>&nbsp\;<br>Join us at <b>7 pm</b>&nbsp\;online on Google Meets:&nbsp\;
 <br><br>https://meet.google.com/nrk-qxzb-ooj<br><br>See you there!<br><br>P
 .S. If you can't make it today\, join any of the following events:<br><br>2
 8. July<br>25. August<br>22. September\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: http
 s://meet.google.com/yhf-ebbz-rnt\nOder telefonisch: (DE) +49 40 8081617860 
 PIN: 788253649#\nWeitere Telefonnummern: https://tel.meet/yhf-ebbz-rnt?pin=
 9910057665310&hs=7\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Meet: https://support.google
 .com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20210823T153043Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EU Can Vote! // Info Event for EU citizens
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
