DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Wahlkampf - New to Berlin and want to talk Politics?
  Join our 'Volt meets Expats' on Thursday at 7pm!<br><br><b>Volt Meets Expa
 ts<br>Thursday\, 7 pm<br>WonderMe: <a href="https://bit.ly/3uhs2Jw">https:/
 /bit.ly/3uhs2Jw</a></b><br><br>After more than a year of Corona-blues the c
 ity is slowly coming back to life. As usual\, many non-German citizens have
  been calling Berlin their new home. Volt Berlin wants to offer our Berlin 
 expats the opportunity to engage with fellow Berliners and learn more about
  the politics &amp\; lifestyle of their new hometown. Voting in the distric
 t elections in September? Mietendeckel? Grillverbot in Parks? Deutsche Wohn
 en? Bürokratieabbau? This event will help you shed light on Berlin’s hottes
 t campaigning topics.<br><br>Join us at 7pm on our WonderMe channel. We're 
 looking forward to chatting with you!\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: https
 ://meet.google.com/njh-yjmj-wtv\nOder telefonisch: (DE) +49 40 8081619266 P
 IN: 170637972#\nWeitere Telefonnummern: https://tel.meet/njh-yjmj-wtv?pin=6
 966539880216&hs=7\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Meet: https://support.google.
 com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20210721T093821Z
LOCATION:https://bit.ly/3uhs2Jw
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Volt Meets Expats // INFO EVENT for EU citizens in Berlin: How to v
 ote for the upcoming elections
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
